<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Exempt Organization Business Income Tax Return</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td { padding: 5px; text-align: left; }
  .header-row td { font-weight: bold; }
  .form-label { font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 0;">Form 990-T</h1>
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Exempt Organization Business Income Tax Return</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">For calendar year <span data-field="tax_year">{{ tax_year }}</span> or other tax year beginning <span data-field="start_date">{{ start_date }}</span>, and ending <span data-field="end_date">{{ end_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">OMB No. 1545-0687</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">20<span data-field="year">{{ year }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%;">
        <div style="font-size: 10pt;">
          <p>Department of the Treasury</p>
          <p>Internal Revenue Service</p>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 75%;">
        <div style="font-size: 10pt;">
          <p>To go to <a href="#" style="color: #000;">www.irs.gov/Form990T</a> for instructions and the latest information.</p>
          <p>Do not enter SSN numbers on this form as this item may be public if your organization is a 501(c)(3).</p>
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 20%;">A Check box if exempt under</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Name of organization</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">EIN</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Employer identification number (EIN) or Taxpayer ID number</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="exempt_status_box_1">{{ exempt_status_box_1 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="ein">{{ ein }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="employer_id">{{ employer_id }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">B Exempt under section</p>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">501(c)(3)</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">501(c)(4)</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">501(c)(5)</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">501(c)(6)</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Other</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 20%;">C Book value of all assets</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">D Gross receipts or sales</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">E Total deductions</td>
      <td style="width: 40%;">F Taxable income</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="book_value_assets">{{ book_value_assets }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="gross_receipts">{{ gross_receipts }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="total_deductions">{{ total_deductions }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="taxable_income">{{ taxable_income }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">F Group exemption number (See instructions.)</p>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 50%;"></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">H Enter the number of the organization's unrelated trades or businesses. <span data-field="unrelated_trades_count">{{ unrelated_trades_count }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">I If only one, complete Parts I-L. If more than one, describe the trades or businesses, then complete Parts III-V.</p>
  </div>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part I Unrelated Trade or Business Income</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">List receipts or sales</p>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 5%;">A</td>
      <td style="width: 45%;">Description</td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">B Income</td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">C Deductions</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Net</td>
    </tr>
    {% for item in line_items %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
      <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].income">{{ item.income }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].deductions">{{ item.deductions }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].net">{{ item.net }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 15px;">J During the tax year, was the corporation a subsidiary in an affiliated group or a parent-subsidiary control group? <span data-field="affiliated_group_yes_no">{{ affiliated_group_yes_no }}</span></p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part II Deductions Not Taken Elsewhere</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(See instructions for limitations on deductions.) (Except for contributions, deductions must be directly connected with the unrelated business income.)</p>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">14</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">15</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">16</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">17</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">18</td>
      <td style="width: 40%;">Description</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_14">{{ deduction_14 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_15">{{ deduction_15 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_16">{{ deduction_16 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_17">{{ deduction_17 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_18">{{ deduction_18 }}</span></td>
      <td>Compensation of officers, directors, and trustees (Schedule K).</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_19">{{ deduction_19 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Salaries and wages</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_20">{{ deduction_20 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Repairs and maintenance</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_21">{{ deduction_21 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Bad debts</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_22">{{ deduction_22 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Interest (attach schedule) (see instructions)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_23">{{ deduction_23 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Taxes and licenses</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_24">{{ deduction_24 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Charitable contributions (See instructions for limitation rules)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_25">{{ deduction_25 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Depreciation (attach Form 4562)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_26">{{ deduction_26 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Less depreciation claimed on Schedule A and elsewhere on return</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_27">{{ deduction_27 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Depletion</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_28">{{ deduction_28 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Contributions to deferred compensation plans</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_29">{{ deduction_29 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Employee benefit programs</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_30">{{ deduction_30 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Excess exempt expenses (Schedule J)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_31">{{ deduction_31 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Excess readership costs (Schedule J)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_32">{{ deduction_32 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Other deductions (attach schedule)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_33">{{ deduction_33 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Total deductions. Add lines 14 through 28.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_34">{{ deduction_34 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Unrelated business taxable income before net operating loss deduction. Subtract line 29 from line 13</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_35">{{ deduction_35 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Deduction for net operating loss arising in tax years beginning on or after January 1, 2018 (see instructions)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="deduction_36">{{ deduction_36 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Unrelated business taxable income. Subtract line 31 from line 30.</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0;">Part IV Tax Computation</h3>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Schedule A - Cost of Goods Sold. Enter method of inventory valuation</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">1</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Beginning inventory of year</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">2</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Cost of goods sold. Subtract line 5. Enter here and in</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">3</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Ending inventory of year</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="cog_sold_1">{{ cog_sold_1 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="cog_sold_2">{{ cog_sold_2 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="cog_sold_3">{{ cog_sold_3 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="cog_sold_4">{{ cog_sold_4 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="cog_sold_5">{{ cog_sold_5 }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">4</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Additional section 263A costs</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">5</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Cost of goods sold. Subtract line 5. Enter here and in</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">6</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="cog_add_4">{{ cog_add_4 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="cog_add_5">{{ cog_add_5 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="cog_add_6">{{ cog_add_6 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="cog_add_7">{{ cog_add_7 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="cog_add_8">{{ cog_add_8 }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Schedule C-Rent Income (From Real Property and Personal Property Leased With Real Property)</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">1</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Description of property</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">2</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Rent received or accrued</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">3</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="rent_desc_1">{{ rent_desc_1 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="rent_received_1">{{ rent_received_1 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Schedule E - Unrelated Debt-Financed Income (See instructions)</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">1</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Description of debt-financed property</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">2</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Gross income from debt-financed property</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">3</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="debt_desc_1">{{ debt_desc_1 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="debt_income_1">{{ debt_income_1 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part V Tax and Payments</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">45a</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Foreign tax credit (corresponds attach Form 1118; trusts attach Form 1116).</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">45b</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Other credits (see instructions).</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">45c</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="tax_credit_45a">{{ tax_credit_45a }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="tax_credit_45b">{{ tax_credit_45b }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">46</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Total tax. Add lines 45 and 47 (see instructions).</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">47</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Other taxes.</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">48</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="total_tax_46">{{ total_tax_46 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="other_taxes_47">{{ other_taxes_47 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">49</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Total tax liability. Add lines 46 and 47.</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">50</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Payments.</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">51</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="total_liability_49">{{ total_liability_49 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="payments_50">{{ payments_50 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">52</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Estimated tax payments.</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">53</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Tax due. If line 51 is less than the total of lines 48, 49, and 52, enter amount owed.</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">54</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="estimated_payments_52">{{ estimated_payments_52 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="tax_due_53">{{ tax_due_53 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">55</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Amount of line 54 you want credited to 2019 estimated tax.</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">56</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Refunded.</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">57</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="credit_55">{{ credit_55 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="refunded_56">{{ refunded_56 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0;">Part VI Statements Regarding Certain Activities and Other Information (see instructions)</h3>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Schedule D (Form 1120)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">Yes</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">No</td>
      <td style="width: 80%;">Description</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="activity_yes_1">{{ activity_yes_1 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="activity_no_1">{{ activity_no_1 }}</span></td>
      <td>Did the organization have an interest in or a signature or other authority over any of the following?</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="activity_yes_2">{{ activity_yes_2 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="activity_no_2">{{ activity_no_2 }}</span></td>
      <td>Did the organization have any political campaign activities?</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="activity_yes_3">{{ activity_yes_3 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="activity_no_3">{{ activity_no_3 }}</span></td>
      <td>Did the organization engage in lobbying activities?</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Sign Here</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Signature of officer</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Printed name</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Title</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Date</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td></td>
      <td><span data-field="signer_name">{{ signer_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="signer_title">{{ signer_title }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="signer_date">{{ signer_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Paid Preparer Use Only</p>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Firm's name</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Firm's EIN</td>
        <td style="width: 40%;">Signature</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="prep_firm_name">{{ prep_firm_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="prep_ein">{{ prep_ein }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0;">Schedule A - Cost of Goods Sold. Enter method of inventory valuation</h3>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Schedule D (Form 1120)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">1</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Beginning inventory of year</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">2</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Cost of goods sold. Subtract line 5. Enter here and in</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">3</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Ending inventory of year</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="sch_a_1">{{ sch_a_1 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="sch_a_2">{{ sch_a_2 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="sch_a_3">{{ sch_a_3 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="sch_a_4">{{ sch_a_4 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="sch_a_5">{{ sch_a_5 }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">4</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Additional section 263A costs</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">5</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Cost of goods sold. Subtract line 5. Enter here and in</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">6</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"></td>
